wf-drug-popup-cocaine-2 = Everything is sharp and bright.
wf-drug-popup-cocaine-3 = You feel like you could run the whole station.
wf-drug-popup-anxious-1 = Your heart is going way too fast.
wf-drug-popup-anxious-2 = Someone is watching you. You're sure of it.
wf-drug-popup-calm-1 = Nothing is worth worrying about.
wf-drug-popup-calm-2 = Your limbs feel heavy and warm.
wf-drug-popup-calm-3 = The world slows down around you.
wf-drug-popup-euphoria-1 = A warm wave rolls through you.
wf-drug-popup-euphoria-2 = Everything is fine. Everything is perfectly fine.
wf-drug-popup-euphoria-3 = Your eyelids are so heavy.
wf-drug-popup-comedown-1 = Everything aches a little.
wf-drug-popup-comedown-2 = The colour has gone out of things.
wf-drug-popup-halo-1 = You love everyone here.
wf-drug-popup-halo-2 = Everyone around you is wonderful.
wf-drug-popup-halo-3 = Music would feel incredible right now.
wf-drug-popup-halo-crash-1 = Nobody really cares about you.
wf-drug-popup-halo-crash-2 = You feel empty and tired.
wf-drug-popup-halo-crash-3 = The warmth is gone.

## Entities

