ent-WFLeavesCoca = coca leaves
    .desc = Glossy green leaves. Grind them for the alkaloid.
ent-WFOpiumPoppySeeds = packet of opium poppy seeds
    .desc = Grows opium poppies. Don't let security read the label.
ent-WFOpiumPoppyPod = opium poppy pod
    .desc = A ripe seed pod, heavy with opium. Grind it for the sap.
ent-WFCrackRock = crack rock
    .desc = A small off-white rock. Smoke it in a pipe or bong.
ent-WFCrystalShard = crystal shard
